WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:03.269
-Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.804
I'm about to have a dance battle
against a very worthy opponent.

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:08.908
Please welcome JoJo Siwa!

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.577
Wow, look at you.
Come on now.

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.044
-Hey!

00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:13.413
-Why would I even do this?

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:15.581
-I'm ready.
I'm ready for "Dance Battle."

00:00:15.581 --> 00:00:16.816
-Here's how it works.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.918
This is the dance-move
generator here,

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:21.121
and I'm going to hit the button,
which will randomly select

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:23.456
a never-before-scene dance move.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.090
So that could be my advantage.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:27.827
These are not done.
These aren't famous moves.

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:31.831
Whoever's turn it is has to make
up a dance for that move,

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:33.733
and the best dancer will win.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:36.269 line:0%
Let's start
the dance-move generator!

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:40.106 line:0%
-Alright, what am I gonna get?

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.875 line:0%
-The "glitter on my sweater."
-What does it say?

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:45.145 line:0%
-The "glitter on my sweater."

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:46.712 line:0%
-Alright, alright, alright.

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:48.814 line:0%
-Alright, here we go.
Can we get some music?

00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:50.483 line:0%
♪♪
-Alright.

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:52.118 line:0%
Let's go, music.

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:59.225 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:01.427 line:0%
-See, she's dancing.

00:01:01.427 --> 00:01:03.195 line:0%
She just owns it. Come on now.

00:01:03.195 --> 00:01:05.231 line:0%
Alright.

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.600 line:0%
Oh, wait a second. Oh, what?

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:10.036 line:0%
She actually -- Oh, come on.
See?

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:12.906 line:0%
Alright, that's not bad.
-Oh, oh, oh, oh!

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.808 line:0%
-Not bad. I like that.
Alright. I'll take that.

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:16.275 line:0%
Here we go. Alright.
I'll take that.

00:01:16.275 --> 00:01:17.810 line:0%
-I like the little flick.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:21.247 line:0%
-Yeah, I like the flip too.
I've never seen the flip before.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:24.917 line:0%
But I don't wear epaulets
all the time, but okay.

00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:28.455 line:0%
Alright, JoJo, it is my turn.
-That makes one of us.

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:30.323 line:0%
These are a daily occurrence
for me.

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:32.792 line:0%
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:34.427 line:0%
-Let's start the generator.

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:43.069 line:0%
The "bartender who does
too much." Hmm.

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:44.570 line:0%
-Well, let's see it.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.672 line:0%
-Alright, the "bartender
who does too much."

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:47.773 line:0%
Okay. Here we go.

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:52.978 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:52.978 --> 00:01:55.615 line:0%
-I got you, I got you,
yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:57.316 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:57.316 --> 00:01:59.318 line:0%
Oh, oh, come on, come on!

00:01:59.318 --> 00:02:01.387 line:0%
Show us how to make it! Yeah!

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:07.293 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:13.199 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:15.101 line:0%
Oh, my God.
-They just wanted --

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:17.036 line:0%
They just wanted a beer,
that's all.

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:19.138 line:0%
He did too much, you see?
[ Laughs ]

00:02:19.138 --> 00:02:23.242 line:0%
-I liked you. You were getting
your teppanyaki work in there.

00:02:23.242 --> 00:02:24.811 line:0%
You were throwing it
and you were cooking it.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.378 line:0%
-He was flipping it
behind the back.

00:02:26.378 --> 00:02:29.082 line:0%
He was going for it. Turns out
he was like, "Oh, a beer?"

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:30.382 line:0%
-I love it.

00:02:30.382 --> 00:02:32.051 line:0%
-[ Exhales deeply ]

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:34.554 line:0%
Alright, Grandpa's
gonna catch his breath. JoJo.

00:02:34.554 --> 00:02:36.388 line:0%
-It's okay, it's okay.
You did good.

00:02:36.388 --> 00:02:38.358 line:0%
-Let's start the generator
for you.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:43.829 line:0%
-Let's do it.
That was full out, Jimmy.

00:02:43.829 --> 00:02:48.167 line:0%
-The "just dropped my phone
and I hope it didn't crack."

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:50.670 line:0%
That's happened to me before.
Never on the dance floor.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.271 line:0%
-Oh, boy.
-But let's see.

00:02:52.271 --> 00:02:55.174 line:0%
"I just dropped my phone
and I hope it didn't crack."

00:02:55.174 --> 00:02:57.276 line:0%
Okay. JoJo.

00:02:57.276 --> 00:02:59.879 line:0%
-I think I need a prop.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:02.615 line:0%
I got a TV remote.
This is gonna be my phone.

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:04.383 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:04.383 --> 00:03:06.252 line:0%
Alright, perfect. Here we go.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:09.021 line:0%
JoJo, when you're ready,
let's start the music.

00:03:09.021 --> 00:03:12.058 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:12.058 --> 00:03:13.859 line:0%
Alright, you're on the phone.

00:03:13.859 --> 00:03:16.195 line:0%
Yeah. Oh, oh! Oh.

00:03:16.195 --> 00:03:21.934 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:27.673 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:27.673 --> 00:03:28.875 line:0%
Oh, subtle. Very subtle.
-It didn't crack!

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:30.243 line:0%
It didn't crack!

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:31.577 line:0%
We're good! We're good!
It didn't crack!

00:03:31.577 --> 00:03:34.246 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:34.246 --> 00:03:37.549 line:0%
-Ah, I did lose my bow
and my ear. Hold on. Hold on.

00:03:37.549 --> 00:03:40.019
-I loved the subtlety.
-My phone didn't crack.

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:41.988
I lost a bow, I lost an ear,

00:03:41.988 --> 00:03:44.490
but my phone did not crack.
That's all that matters.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.892
-No, I loved the subtlety of
like, "Oh, I'm still dancing."

00:03:46.892 --> 00:03:48.527
Then you go, "Let me just
take a peek real quick.

00:03:48.527 --> 00:03:50.663
Yeah, it's not cracked.
We're good. I'm still cool."

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:52.699
-It was the slow turn around.

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:55.001
-You crushed that!
Okay, you crushed that.

00:03:55.001 --> 00:03:58.437
JoJo, you're clearly
the better dancer.

00:03:58.437 --> 00:04:00.973
Alright, why even compete
against each other

00:04:00.973 --> 00:04:03.576
when we can do
one more together?

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:07.313
For this last dance
we pre-selected...

00:04:08.848 --> 00:04:13.619 line:0%
"the flying ponycopter."
-Oh, oh, it's on, baby!

00:04:13.619 --> 00:04:15.721 line:0%
-I'm gonna need a little help
for this one.

00:04:15.721 --> 00:04:17.890 line:0%
Thank you very much.
I am very excited.

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:20.860 line:0%
-Uh-oh. What do you got?

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.761 line:0%
-I'm very excited about this.

00:04:22.761 --> 00:04:25.030 line:0%
-That is beautiful, Jimmy.

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.399 line:0%
-Thank you so much.

00:04:26.399 --> 00:04:28.835 line:0%
I wore this to work today
but made sure

00:04:28.835 --> 00:04:30.770 line:0%
it didn't get wet
with all the snow and stuff.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:34.874 line:0%
So here we go.
This is the flying ponycopter.

00:04:34.874 --> 00:04:37.042 line:0%
-That is incredible.
-Alright, ready?

00:04:37.042 --> 00:04:38.577 line:0%
Music whenever.

00:04:38.577 --> 00:04:47.519 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:47.519 --> 00:04:49.488 line:0%
-I lost my bow!

00:04:49.488 --> 00:04:51.824 line:0%
-[ Laughing ] Oh, my God.

00:04:51.824 --> 00:04:53.959 line:0%
Oh, I don't know how you do it.
Alright.

00:04:53.959 --> 00:04:55.361 line:0%
You are a legend!

00:04:55.361 --> 00:04:57.863 line:0%
That is all the time we have
for "Tonight Show" Dance Battle!

00:04:57.863 --> 00:04:59.432 line:0%
Our thanks to JoJo Siwa!

